{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0057", "block": 57, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 302, "sha256": "2ac4442557f02fce", "text": "[Graphite Agent](https://graphite.com/features/agent) is designed to address many of these common challenges out of the box. With intelligent filtering, contextual understanding, and seamless GitHub integration, it helps teams avoid false positive fatigue while maintaining high code quality standards."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0058", "block": 58, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 75, "sha256": "64496af00c38ccb4", "text": "Conclusion</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#conclusion>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0059", "block": 59, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 445, "sha256": "e953bc4a9b720144", "text": "AI code review tools like [Graphite Agent](https://graphite.com/features/agent) are transforming development practices by providing faster, more consistent analysis while reducing the burden on human reviewers. By implementing the best practices outlined in this guide and approaching AI code review as a complement to human expertise rather than a replacement, teams can significantly improve code quality, security, and developer productivity."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0060", "block": 60, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 291, "sha256": "a2ecc455e58e2a0a", "text": "Remember that AI code review is most effective when it's part of a comprehensive quality strategy that includes testing, documentation, and thoughtful human oversight. The goal is not to eliminate human judgment but to enhance it by automating routine checks and providing valuable insights."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0061", "block": 61, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 107, "sha256": "2fae9363dc1abb23", "text": "Frequently asked questions</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#frequently-asked-questions>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0062", "block": 62, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 130, "sha256": "3ae34f39b2b11881", "text": "How accurate are AI code review tools?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-accurate-are-ai-code-review-tools>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0063", "block": 63, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 333, "sha256": "394b4bb1a0555dc4", "text": "AI code review tools typically achieve 70-90% accuracy for common issues like syntax errors, style violations, and basic security vulnerabilities. However, accuracy varies significantly based on the complexity of the issue and the specific tool. For architectural decisions and complex business logic, human review remains essential."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0064", "block": 64, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 158, "sha256": "37ff827b9ecf01f1", "text": "Can AI code review replace human reviewers entirely?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#can-ai-code-review-replace-human-reviewers-entirely>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0065", "block": 65, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 336, "sha256": "7535b0dfa669c628", "text": "No, AI code review should complement rather than replace human reviewers. While AI excels at catching routine issues and maintaining consistency, human reviewers are still needed for architectural decisions, business logic validation, and complex problem-solving. The most effective approach combines AI automation with human expertise."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0066", "block": 66, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 154, "sha256": "58c3768254f8bd59", "text": "How do I convince my team to adopt AI code review?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-do-i-convince-my-team-to-adopt-ai-code-review>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0067", "block": 67, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 297, "sha256": "161c9a42e2c5817d", "text": "Start with a pilot program involving enthusiastic team members. Demonstrate clear value by showing time savings, improved code quality metrics, and reduced bug rates. Address concerns about job security by positioning AI as a productivity tool that allows developers to focus on higher-value work."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0068", "block": 68, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 158, "sha256": "f0ccb06860ecf673", "text": "How do I handle false positives from AI code review?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-do-i-handle-false-positives-from-ai-code-review>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0069", "block": 69, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 269, "sha256": "b69fca22be8fb3ad", "text": "Implement a feedback loop where developers can mark suggestions as false positives. Most tools allow you to tune sensitivity settings and create ignore patterns for specific code patterns. Regular review of false positives helps improve the system's accuracy over time."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0070", "block": 70, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 154, "sha256": "3b63c82b2bed20b6", "text": "Is my code secure when using AI code review tools?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#is-my-code-secure-when-using-ai-code-review-tools>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0071", "block": 71, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 300, "sha256": "457503ae1f5b5291", "text": "Security depends on the tool and deployment model. Cloud-based tools may process your code on external servers, while on-premises solutions keep code within your infrastructure. Review each tool's data handling policies and consider your organization's security requirements when choosing a solution."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0072", "block": 72, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 160, "sha256": "ada0eb325bdb8e7e", "text": "Will AI code review slow down my development process?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#will-ai-code-review-slow-down-my-development-process>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0073", "block": 73, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 293, "sha256": "5e414c268ffdbb88", "text": "Initially, there may be a slight learning curve, but most teams see net time savings within 2-4 weeks. AI catches issues early, reducing debugging time and review cycles. The key is proper configuration to focus on high-impact issues rather than overwhelming developers with minor suggestions."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0074", "block": 74, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 185, "sha256": "8f886342cc4ac633", "text": "How do I integrate AI code review with my existing CI/CD pipeline?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-do-i-integrate-ai-code-review-with-my-existing-cicd-pipeline>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0075", "block": 75, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 283, "sha256": "5b5d97b3517650fa", "text": "Most AI code review tools offer API integrations and webhook support. You can typically integrate them as a step in your CI pipeline or as automated checks on pull requests. Start with basic integration and gradually add more sophisticated workflows as your team becomes comfortable."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0076", "block": 76, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 172, "sha256": "f230da9cf11154cb", "text": "How do I balance AI suggestions with team coding standards?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-do-i-balance-ai-suggestions-with-team-coding-standards>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0077", "block": 77, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 257, "sha256": "e070870dfa98d4a9", "text": "Configure the AI tool to align with your existing coding standards and style guides. Most tools allow customization of rules and can learn from your codebase patterns. Regularly review and adjust configurations based on team feedback and evolving standards."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0078", "block": 78, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 184, "sha256": "0a1e4647bed3970d", "text": "How do I measure the success of my AI code review implementation?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#how-do-i-measure-the-success-of-my-ai-code-review-implementation>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0079", "block": 79, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 233, "sha256": "cf87226e0e358449", "text": "Track metrics like reduction in production bugs, time saved in code reviews, developer satisfaction scores, and code quality improvements. Set baseline measurements before implementation and compare results after 3-6 months of usage."}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0080", "block": 80, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 225, "sha256": "b3240560cb33d9a8", "text": "The AI is missing important issues that human reviewers catch. How can I improve this?</guides/ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#the-ai-is-missing-important-issues-that-human-reviewers-catch-how-can-i-improve-this>"}
{"slug": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices", "id": "graphite-dev-guides-ai-code-review-implementation-best-practices#b0081", "block": 81, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 313, "sha256": "c7bfd46e4ebb183c", "text": "This is common and expected. AI tools excel at pattern recognition but may miss context-specific issues. Supplement AI review with human oversight, especially for complex logic and architectural decisions. Use AI feedback to improve the tool's configuration and consider custom rules for domain-specific patterns."}
